  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Stir in the ground poppy seeds and cook for 2 minutes, until lightly toasted.",
    "Add the ferment-jang, malt syrup, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the mixture is heated through.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional poppy seeds if desired."
